# Fixture cases for skills/pipeline/scripts/valve.sh.
# Every case starts from the files in this directory: config.json (the
# FACTORY_HOME config beside the run dirs), run/ (a round-2 run that trips
# nothing: a ledger with only fixed, deferred and non-consecutive entries,
# FINDINGS verdicts, a CI finding that repeats nothing, a decision only in
# round 1's builder report, 2 of 3 fix passes with outcome complete, budgets
# under their limits) and bare/ (a run dir holding only status.json).
#
#   === <case name>
#   args: <words passed to the script; split on spaces, no quoting>
#   exit: <expected exit code>
#   stdout:
#   <expected stdout, one line per line; nothing for empty output>
#   patch:
#   <optional unified diff applied to the base files before the run>

